  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups sliced mushrooms",
    "2 large eggs, beaten",
    "1 cup seasoned bread crumbs",
    "4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "6 ounces mozzarella cheese, sliced",
    "0.75 cup chicken broth"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 1/2 of the mushrooms in a 9x13-inch pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ts3xdXfoKYEovKXVqxlAYtJMsqc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8493-Chicken-With-Mushrooms-ddmfs-4x3-step2-805d062fbad543148cda3a599b25f04a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8493/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs to a shallow dish. Add bread crumbs to a second shallow dish. Dip chicken into beaten eggs, then roll in bread crumbs. Melt butter in a skillet over medium heat. Brown chicken on both sides.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H9GBjrjS_C2LSeEWkDt9iZ8-FL4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8493-Chicken-With-Mushrooms-ddmfs-4x3-step3-e901c69389f343b9bcbae0bf5227abe1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8493/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken on top of mushrooms in the pan. Arrange remaining mushrooms over chicken and top with mozzarella cheese. Add chicken broth to the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wP5TbIsSCKH-zgpuyb_8tThxUmI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8493-Chicken-With-Mushrooms-ddmfs-4x3-step4-28c2620afc3b48e1ab67984aa8dcc829.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8493/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink and juices run clear, 30 to 35 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J3ZiY7qKm-W0IDhJxI0brcQOMRU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8493-chicken-with-mushrooms-ddmfs-3X4-0519-bf2ddfe117224afe9108a7539e9232fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8493/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
